PureSlate NOTICE
================

PureSlate is an original open-source PC cleaning tool. This notice documents
its provenance and clean-room status.

Architecture Influences
-----------------------
The high-level product paradigm (read-only scan -> safety grading -> human
confirmation -> disposition -> structured audit log) is a common pattern found
in many system utilities. The design direction draws architectural inspiration
from Dism++ (MIT licensed). However:

  * No source code from Dism++ or Lenovo PC Manager is copied, translated,
    or repurposed.
  * No cleanup parameters, rule files, resource files, brand words, or assets
    are reused from those projects.
  * All rule XML definitions are independently authored for PureSlate.

